WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Warm welcome to this module. There is no failure only feedback. So what does this mean and why is this so important?

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:19.000
In fact, this is so important that if this is not in place when I've been working with business leaders, athletes, if this component is not in place,

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
as in if they haven't learnt this lesson, progress does not happen. That's how important it is.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:39.000
So this module is all about exploring how do we see and what is our relationship to failure or challenges or setbacks?

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:46.000
How do we approach it? How does it make us feel? How do we react to how we feel? What is our perception of it?

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Because this is absolutely key. So in the next video, we're going to look at an animation that I put together for the athletes I used to work with.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:02.000
And it's going to look at the relationship that we have to failure. How do we see it?

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:08.000
And then when we come back from that, we're going to unpack this a bit more together. Enjoy.